+// CENSUS (C's answers, buster#2850's step 2): a line for each record of an expression C ran on (taken, or refused for
+// a template or a row), with what the window has of it, of its operands and of its consumer, and what C answered.
+// --census-c-lines turns it on. An experiment's patch: no pull request has it.
+static uint32_t census_c_lines;
